cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "trosna-regime-control: regime detection from reallocation decisions, scale-invariant monitoring and simplex memory allocation for adaptive KVM"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for the methods of the article on Lie groups and martingales
  in adaptive KVM memory management: memory shares on the simplex with
  clr coordinates, bounds and a dead band; monitoring intervals by scale-invariant
  rules; real-time decision intensity with exponential forgetting; Shiryaev–Roberts
  and CUSUM detectors on Bernoulli decisions at irregular intervals with an ARL
  bound; the exact flicker of the 5-bit heuristic; a streaming regime controller
  and a command-line tool.
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
